==Strategy==
Make sure you use high damage attackers against the Mr. Puffingtons to avoid desyncing their attacks. If they attack all at once, it will do more damage to the hit cats, but the enemies will push forward slower.

It is possible beat this stage under 53 seconds, but you have to let your Cats tank Mr. Puffington as well as deal with the Capies behind the base.

If you have [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]], you can at some point, stop meatshielding all of a sudden, causing the Puffingtons who are alive to all hit your base and stack up there. once they are there, summon Idi, then use the [[Ototo Corps|Slow Beam]]. This will allow Idi to hit twice and kill them all. You can only use this trick once, realistically, but it will make the stage significantly easier.

You can also use lots and lots of meatshields combined with a backliner like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]] to take down this stage easily. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] for double bounty on the Pengs so you can afford your backliner in time.

